  "notes": "FORMATION:\n{公|こう} (public) + {布|ふ} (spread, distribute) → spreading publicly\n\nVERB FORM:\n{公布|こうふ}する (to promulgate)\n\nLEGAL PROCESS:\n{公布|こうふ} (promulgation) → {施行|しこう} (enforcement)\n\nCOLLOCATIONS:\n- {法律|ほうりつ}を{公布|こうふ}する (to promulgate a law)\n- {公布|こうふ}{日|び} (date of promulgation)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {施行|しこう} (enforcement, implementation)\n- {制定|せいてい} (enactment)\n- {発布|はっぷ} (proclamation, promulgation)",
